OL,3,CAll major Italian cities on red heat
OL,4,Calert as heatwave rips through Europe
OL,6,FItaly has placed all of its major
OL,7,Fcities under the highest heat alert on
OL,8,FThursday, as a blistering heatwave
OL,9,Fgrips Europe.
OL,11,FThe heatwave has set a national
OL,12,Ftemperature record in Austria, fuelled
OL,13,Fwildfires in France, and disrupted
OL,14,Fenergy and transport systems across
OL,15,Fthe continent.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
