FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786114088
OL,3,CAll major Italian cities on red heat
OL,4,Calert as heatwave rips through Europe
OL,6,FItaly's Health Ministry placed all 27
OL,7,Fcities monitored under its national
OL,8,Fheat surveillance system on red alert,
OL,9,Fthe first time this year the entire
OL,10,Fnetwork has been under its highest
OL,11,Fwarning level simultaneously.
OL,13,FThe alerts stretch from Trieste in the
OL,14,Fnortheast, to Palermo in Sicily, and
OL,15,Findicate a health risk for the entire
OL,16,Fpopulation, not just vulnerable groups
OL,17,Fsuch as older people and those with
OL,18,Fchronic illnesses.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
