PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786114088
OL,3,CAll major Italian cities on red heat
OL,4,Calert as heatwave rips through Europe
OL,6,FThe total list of cities is: Ancona,
OL,7,FBari, Bologna, Bolzano, Brescia,
OL,8,FCagliari, Campobasso, Catania,
OL,9,FCivitavecchia, Florence, Frosinone,
OL,10,FGenoa, Latina, Messina, Milan, Naples,
OL,11,FPalermo, Perugia, Pescara, Reggio
OL,12,FCalabria, Rieti, Rome, Trieste, Turin,
OL,13,FVenice, Verona and Viterbo.
OL,15,FAuthorities are urging residents and
OL,16,Ftourists to avoid direct sunlight
OL,17,Fduring the hottest part of the day,
OL,18,Fstay indoors where possible, and drink
OL,19,Fplenty of water.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
