OL,3,CAll major Italian cities on red heat
OL,4,Calert as heatwave rips through Europe
OL,6,FOn Thursday, Slovakia recorded a new
OL,7,Fall-time high temperature of 42.2C at
OL,8,FDolne Plachtince, in the south of the
OL,9,Fcountry, according to the Slovak
OL,10,FMeteorological Institute.
OL,12,FLow water levels on the Danube also
OL,13,Fforced Slovakia's largest
OL,14,Fhydroelectric power plant at Gabcikovo
OL,15,Fto shut down seven of its eight
OL,16,Fturbines, the TASR news agency
OL,17,Freported.
