OL,3,CAll major Italian cities on red heat
OL,4,Calert as heatwave rips through Europe
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FIn southeastern France, firefighters
OL,12,Fmaintained a major presence in the Var
OL,13,Fregion after authorities said a large
OL,14,Fwildfire was no longer spreading but
OL,15,Fremained at risk of reigniting.
OL,17,FThe blaze, which began on July 20, has
OL,18,Fburned more than 60 square kilometres
OL,19,F(23 square miles), making it the
OL,20,Flargest recorded in the region in
OL,21,Frecent decades.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
