OL,3,CAll major Italian cities on red heat
OL,4,Calert as heatwave rips through Europe
OL,6,FAuthorities warned that strong winds
OL,7,Fand exceptionally dry conditions have
OL,8,Fcontinued to leave southeastern France
OL,9,Fat a very high risk of further
OL,10,Fwildfires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
